<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>No mortal can with Him compare</l><l>Among the sons of men;</l><l>Fairer is He than all the fair</l><l>That fill the heavenly train.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To Him I owe my life and breath,</l><l>And all the joys I have;</l><l>He makes me triumph over death,</l><l>And saves me from the grave.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To God, the Father, my abode,</l><l>He brings my weary feet;</l><l>Shows me the glories of my God,</l><l>And makes my joys complete.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Since from His bounty I receive</l><l>Such proofs of love divine,</l><l>Had I a thousand hearts to give,</l><l>Lord, they should all be Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
